<title>UK: UK DELIVERED GRAIN TRADES - AUG 13.</title>
<headline>UK DELIVERED GRAIN TRADES - AUG 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 percent protein to London asa 105.00/05.50 Sep 107.50</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk this week 80.00 asa 81.00/82.00 Oct/Dec 90.00/90.50</p>
<p>Southampton asa 81.00/82.00</p>
<p>Avon Sep 84.50/84.00 Oct/Dec 89.00/90.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to East Anglia asa 75.50/76.00</p>
<p>Lincolnshire asa 76.00</p>
<p>Southampton asa 76.00</p>
<p>Tilbury asa 75.00</p>
